</div></section><section id="faq" class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28"><div class="container"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-16"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-brand uppercase">FAQ</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem]">Questions students actually ask</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Still unsure about something? Send us a message and we'll answer it properly.</p><a class="group mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-brand-dark transition-colors hover:text-brand" href="https://my-classmate-ekkg5emd.share.landingsite.dev/contact" data-discover="true">Ask a question<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="space-y-3"><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white px-5 transition-colors open:border-brand/40 open:bg-brand-tint/40" open=""><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-semibold text-ink marker:content-none"><span class="text-base">Does the AI just give me the answers?</span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-tint text-brand-dark transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-brand group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="pr-10 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">No â€” and that's deliberate. My Classmate prioritises teaching: it explains the reasoning, breaks problems into steps and checks your understanding. It's built to help you learn the topic, not to produce work you'd hand in as your own.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white px-5 transition-colors open:border-brand/40 open:bg-brand-tint/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-semibold text-ink marker:content-none"><span class="text-base">Will it work on my phone?</span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-tint text-brand-dark transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-brand group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="pr-10 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Yes. My Classmate is designed mobile-first, with a bottom navigation bar and layouts built for small screens. It works smoothly on Android and iPhone, and scales up nicely on a laptop or tablet.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white px-5 transition-colors open:border-brand/40 open:bg-brand-tint/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-semibold text-ink marker:content-none"><span class="text-base">What's the difference between Free and Premium?</span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-tint text-brand-dark transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-brand group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="pr-10 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Free gives you the full planner â€” dashboard, assignments, subjects, notes, calendar and a basic study planner, plus limited AI usage. Premium unlocks the advanced AI Classmate: unlimited usage, AI quizzes, flashcards, summaries, advanced study planning and deeper progress tracking.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white px-5 transition-colors open:border-brand/40 open:bg-brand-tint/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-semibold text-ink marker:content-none"><span class="text-base">Can I use it for university as well as school?</span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-tint text-brand-dark transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-brand group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="pr-10 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Absolutely. It's built for secondary-school and university students alike. Subjects, projects, exams and study sessions work the same way at any level â€” you just add the subjects you're taking.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white px-5 transition-colors open:border-brand/40 open:bg-brand-tint/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-semibold text-ink marker:content-none"><span class="text-base">Who can see my notes and grades?</span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-tint text-brand-dark transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-brand group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="pr-10 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Only you. Your notes, grades and study data are private to your account. The optional community area is the only shared space, and it never exposes personal student information.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white px-5 transition-colors open:border-brand/40 open:bg-brand-tint/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-semibold text-ink marker:content-none"><span class="text-base">Do I need to pay to start?</span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-tint text-brand-dark transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 group-open:bg-brand group-open:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="pr-10 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">No. You can create a free account and use the planner without entering any payment details. Upgrade to Premium only if and when you want the advanced AI tools.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section id="waitlist" class="relative isolate scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden bg-ink py-20 md:py-28"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolut